            "text": "{\"task\":{\"created_at\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:35.953841Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:35.953841Z\",\"org_id\":\"01a181ae-43f5-77de-80f4-195c2094cb91\",\"project_id\":\"01a181b1-49cc-728c-a9b6-467265bbbb47\",\"id\":\"01a181b1-800f-7379-b9aa-d3f3e6a2cbeb\",\"title\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in…\",\"display_index\":4,\"status\":\"pending\",\"kind\":\"agent\",\"member_id\":\"01a181ae-440f-76a7-86fd-6d5ef512f409\",\"automation_id\":null,\"runtime_group_id\":\"01a181b1-5a12-7261-bf2a-e4dc7d60e208\",\"runtime_id\":\"01a181b1-5ed1-74c4-976e-3653192076c4\",\"is_archived\":false,\"started_at\":null,\"completed_at\":null,\"last_user_message_at\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:35.955012Z\",\"metadata\":{\"error\":null,\"suite\":\"walk\",\"agent_name\":\"scripted\",\"task_prompt\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in the shell and reply in one short sentence.\\n\\n<<SCRIPT {\\\"reply\\\":\\\"Echoed the message through hello-mcp and wrote it to the outputs file.\\\",\\\"tools\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hello-mcp_echo\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"message\\\":\\\"hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Echo: hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"bash\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"command\\\":\\\"echo $WALK_MARKER\\\"}}]}>>\",\"active_run_id\":\"01a181b1-800f-7379-b9aa-d3f28c035b2f\",\"latest_run_id\":\"01a181b1-800f-7379-b9aa-d3f28c035b2f\",\"crash_restarts\":null,\"history_recall\":null,\"conversation_id\":\"01a181b1-800