            "size": 3536,
            "text": "[{\"role\":\"meta\",\"source\":\"hello-mcp\",\"model\":\"scripted-llm\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Use the declared hello MCP whenever the task asks you to echo a message.\\n## Managed workspace\\n\\n<workspace>\\n  <inputs path=\\\"/workspace/files\\\" access=\\\"read_write\\\" persistence=\\\"task\\\" />\\n  <outputs path=\\\"/workspace/outputs\\\" persistence=\\\"task\\\" />\\n  Save downloaded source material under files/ and deliverables under outputs/. Mounted uploads and recipe files remain read-only; use a new path for modified copies.\\n</workspace>\\nUploaded inputs are read-only. Put intentional task deliverables in the outputs path so the platform can persist them.\\n\\n\\n## Session\\n\\n<session visibility=\\\"project\\\">\\n  <permissions plane=\\\"data\\\">annotations:read conversations:read events:read files:read files:write metrics:read shares:read shares:write tasks:read tasks:write repositories:write telemetry:write git:read</permissions>\\n</session>\\n\\n<cwd>\\n/workspace\\n</cwd>\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:38.469000Z\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in the shell and reply in one short sentence.\\n\\n<<SCRIPT {\\\"reply\\\":\\\"Echoed the message through hello-mcp and wrote it to the outputs file.\\\",\\\"tools\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hello-mcp_echo\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"message\\\":\\\"hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Echo: hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"bash\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"command\\\":\\\"echo $WALK_MARKER\\\"}}]}>>\\n\\n<files>\\n<file path=\\\"/workspace/files/walk-input.txt\\\" />\\n</files>\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:38.469000Z\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":null,\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:38.469000Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"call_e4b3cc8838c6471981317ecc\",\"name\":\"hello-mcp_echo\",\"args\":\"{\\\"message\\\": \\\"hello from the public MCP\\\"}\"}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"call_e4b3cc8838c6471981317ecc\",\"content\":\"Tool hello-mcp_echo not found\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:38.542000Z\",\"ok\":false},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":null,\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:38.542000Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"call_cba2c738bfe2435dac889802\",\"name\":\"write\",\"args\":\"{\\\"content\\\": \\\"Echo: hello from the public MCP\\\", \\\"path\\\": \\\"/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt\\\"}\"}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"call_cba2c738bfe2435dac889802\",\"content\":\"Successfully wrote to /workspace/outputs/greeting.txt\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:38.563000Z\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":null,\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:38.563000Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"call_cda0e15c95e143b29cd361aa\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"args\":\"{\\\"command\\\": \\\"echo $WALK_MARKER\\\"}\"}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"call_cda0e15c95e143b29cd361aa\",\"content\":\"walk-marker-7f3a\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:38.593000Z\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"Echoed the message through hello-mcp and wrote it to the outputs file.\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:38.593000Z\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Reply with the single word done. <<SCRIPT {\\\"reply\\\":\\\"done\\\"}>>\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:38.926000Z\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"done\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:38.926000Z\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Reply with the single word done. <<SCRIPT {\\\"reply\\\":\\\"done\\\"}>>\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:39.285000Z\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"done\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-28T08:47:39.285000Z\"}]"
